rsians">Persians</a> besiege <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constantinople">Constantinople</a> and fail</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 631</span><span class="rf-text">A struggle for the khaganate between an <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/avars">Avar</a> and a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bulgars">Bulgar</a> candidate</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">791</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charlemagne">Charlemagne</a> campaigns down the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/danube">Danube</a> against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/avars">Avars</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">795–796</span><span class="rf-text">Frankish forces capture the Ring and carry off the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/avars">Avar</a> treasure</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">822</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/avars">Avar</a> envoys at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frankfurt">Frankfurt</a>; the last mention of the Avars</span></li></ol>
